## Module-by-Module Verification

### 1. Core Engine ([core/engine.py](file:///c:/Rahul/06_Nikku/Strategies/PureOptionsBot/core/engine.py))
**Documented Promise:** "AsyncIO orchestrator - coordinates all components"

**Actual Implementation:** ✅ CONFIRMED
- [TradingEngine](file:///c:/Rahul/06_Nikku/Strategies/PureOptionsBot/core/engine.py#31-483) class with 21 methods
- 3 concurrent async tasks as promised:
  - [signal_scanner_task()](file:///c:/Rahul/06_Nikku/Strategies/PureOptionsBot/core/engine.py#254-274) - every 5s
  - [risk_monitor_task()](file:///c:/Rahul/06_Nikku/Strategies/PureOptionsBot/core/engine.py#333-352) - every 1s  
  - [position_sync_task()](file:///c:/Rahul/06_Nikku/Strategies/PureOptionsBot/core/engine.py#680-696) - every 10s
- **Bonus**: Added entry execution methods (6 new methods for Phase 1)

### 2. State Machine ([core/state_machine.py](file:///c:/Rahul/06_Nikku/Strategies/PureOptionsBot/core/state_machine.py))
**Documented Promise:** "Trade lifecycle management with valid state transitions"

**Actual Implementation:** ✅ CONFIRMED
- [TradeState](file:///c:/Rahul/06_Nikku/Strategies/PureOptionsBot/core/state_machine.py#14-30) enum with 7 states (IDLE → OBSERVING → ENTERING → POSITION → EXITING → EXITED + BLOCKED)
- [Trade](file:///c:/Rahul/06_Nikku/Strategies/PureOptionsBot/core/state_machine.py#32-173) dataclass (immutable trade state)
- [TradeStateMachine](file:///c:/Rahul/06_Nikku/Strategies/PureOptionsBot/core/state_machine.py#175-249) with transition validation
- State flow exactly as documented in README

### 3. Persistence ([core/persistence.py](file:///c:/Rahul/06_Nikku/Strategies/PureOptionsBot/core/persistence.py))
**Documented Promise:** "SQLite crash recovery"

**Actual Implementation:** ✅ CONFIRMED
- `TradePersistence` class
- Database: [bot_state.db](file:///c:/Rahul/06_Nikku/Strategies/PureOptionsBot/bot_state.db)
- Methods: `load_active_trades()`, `save_trade()`, `archive_trade()`
- Crash recovery on startup as shown in README examples

### 4. Indicators ([indicators/](file:///c:/Rahul/06_Nikku/Strategies/PureOptionsBot/core/engine.py#88-123))
**Documented Promise:** "Plugin system - easy to add new indicators"

**Actual Implementation:** ✅ CONFIRMED + ENHANCED
- [base.py](file:///c:/Rahul/06_Nikku/Strategies/PureOptionsBot/indicators/base.py) - Abstract [BaseIndicator](file:///c:/Rahul/06_Nikku/Strategies/PureOptionsBot/indicators/base.py#55-143) class with plugin interface
- [IndicatorSignal](file:///c:/Rahul/06_Nikku/Strategies/PureOptionsBot/indicators/base.py#14-53) - Standardized output format
- [utbot.py](file:///c:/Rahul/06_Nikku/Strategies/PureOptionsBot/debug_utbot.py) - UTBot indicator (backward compatible with old bot)
- [registry.py](file:///c:/Rahul/06_Nikku/Strategies/PureOptionsBot/indicators/registry.py) - Factory pattern for indicator creation
- **Plugin system works exactly as documented** - can add RSI/Supertrend without touching core

### 5. Risk Management ([risk/manager.py](file:///c:/Rahul/06_Nikku/Strategies/PureOptionsBot/risk/manager.py))
**Documented Promise:** "TSL + 3-stage profit guards"

**Actual Implementation:** ✅ CONFIRMED
- [RiskManager](file:///c:/Rahul/06_Nikku/Strategies/PureOptionsBot/risk/manager.py#137-279) class
- [TrailingStopManager](file:///c:/Rahul/06_Nikku/Strategies/PureOptionsBot/risk/manager.py#39-135) with 3 modes (ATR/PERCENT/POINTS)
- 3-stage profit guard implementation
- Daily P&L tracking
- All features match README description

### 6. Order Execution ([execution/order_manager.py](file:///c:/Rahul/06_Nikku/Strategies/PureOptionsBot/execution/order_manager.py))
**Documented Promise:** "Async order execution with LIMIT→MARKET fallback"

**Actual Implementation:** ✅ CONFIRMED
- [OrderManager](file:///c:/Rahul/06_Nikku/Strategies/PureOptionsBot/execution/order_manager.py#41-365) class
- LIMIT order with timeout polling (0.5s intervals)
- Automatic fallback to MARKET on timeout
- Retry logic on failures
- **Exactly as documented in README example**

### 7. Data Provider ([data/provider.py](file:///c:/Rahul/06_Nikku/Strategies/PureOptionsBot/data/provider.py) + [data/cache.py](file:///c:/Rahul/06_Nikku/Strategies/PureOptionsBot/data/cache.py))
**Documented Promise:** "Market data (async) with TTL caching"

**Actual Implementation:** ✅ CONFIRMED
- [MarketDataProvider](file:///c:/Rahul/06_Nikku/Strategies/PureOptionsBot/data/provider.py#15-273) - Async history fetch
- `MarketDataCache` - LRU cache with TTL
- Cache stats tracking (hit rates)
- **Bonus**: WebSocket LTP integration

