## Feature Comparison: Documented vs Actual

| Feature (from README) | Status | Notes |
|------------------------|--------|-------|
| ✅ Crash Recovery | **WORKING** | SQLite persistence, auto-restore on startup |
| ✅ Async I/O | **WORKING** | 3 concurrent tasks, non-blocking |
| ✅ Plugin System | **WORKING** | Can add indicators without touching core |
| ✅ 3-Stage Profit Guard | **WORKING** | TrailingStopManager with configurable guards |
| ✅ 100% Backward Compatible | **WORKING** | Same UTBot indicator/signals as v1 |
| ✅ LIMIT→MARKET Fallback | **WORKING** | OrderManager polls and auto-converts |
| ✅ TTL Caching | **WORKING** | 60-80% hit rate as documented |

