## Bonus Features (Not in Original README)

The implementation **exceeds** the documented architecture with:

### 1. WebSocket Integration ✨
- [_setup_websocket()](file:///c:/Rahul/06_Nikku/Strategies/PureOptionsBot/core/engine.py#174-222) - Connects to OpenAlgo WS
- [_on_ws_ltp_update()](file:///c:/Rahul/06_Nikku/Strategies/PureOptionsBot/core/engine.py#223-236) - Real-time price updates
- Auto-subscribes to manual strikes
- LTP cache integration

### 2. Entry Execution Logic ✨
- [_scan_manual_strikes()](file:///c:/Rahul/06_Nikku/Strategies/PureOptionsBot/core/engine.py#392-451) - Basket scanning
- [_check_and_execute_entry()](file:///c:/Rahul/06_Nikku/Strategies/PureOptionsBot/core/engine.py#452-515) - Trigger mode validation (STATE/SIGNAL)
- [_execute_entry()](file:///c:/Rahul/06_Nikku/Strategies/PureOptionsBot/core/engine.py#516-579) - Order placement + Trade creation
- Max price cap validation

### 3. Re-Entry Protection ✨
- [_is_symbol_on_cooldown()](file:///c:/Rahul/06_Nikku/Strategies/PureOptionsBot/core/engine.py#366-391) - Anti-whipsaw logic
- Cooldown tracking on exits
- Configurable cooldown duration

### 4. Trading Hours Enforcement ✨
- [_is_within_trading_hours()](file:///c:/Rahul/06_Nikku/Strategies/PureOptionsBot/core/engine.py#342-365) - Start/end time validation
- Lunch break pause support
- Entry blocking outside hours

### 5. Enhanced Logging ✨
- Startup banner with config summary
- Heartbeat with index price + trend states
- Position count in logs
- Suppressed verbose HTTP logs

